  2023

  **Charlie Kirk is hitting hard everyday on Twitter regarding American
  involvement

  in the Ukrainian War. He is accusing Ukraine and Zelensky of corruption and

  financial fraud

  January 10th-19th: Rob McCoy hosts the first ever TPUSA Faith Pastors' tour of
  Israel.

  He guides a group of Pastors through Jerusalem

  February 20th: James O'Keefe is ousted from the board at his own company and

  Charlie announces his support for what the public perceives to be a hostile
